    "9": {
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Looks like I gotta hide the jewel."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Stop doing that kind of \"I'm hiding something\" face!"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let's battle!"
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, it's Marisa",
                "the thief."
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "My treasure-sensing rods are picking up a faint signal."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It looks like it could be around here!"
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh... I think I know you."
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're Tesso, right?",
                "I heard the rumors about you."
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh?",
                "No, I'm not."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh?",
                "But I heard you live in the temple."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I live there, but you're mistaken.",
                "I'm not Tesso."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Since you live in a temple,",
                "isn't it the same thing?"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What's with all this useless bickering?"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...No, wait.",
                "My rods are still picking up a faint signal."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...I see."
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You have the jewel, don't you?"
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh? Jewel?",
                "I've got nothing, I swear!"
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Enough bluffing!",
                "I'll just force the truth out of you!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "See, I knew it, look at this... nothing!?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then what was this all about?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<i$I> should be asking <i$you> that!"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But I'm impressed.",
                "That nose of yours really is sharp."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I actually <i$did> have a jewel",
                "not too long ago."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh?"
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I didn't want a treasure hunter",
                "like you to find out about it..."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've changed my mind after seeing your skill.",
                "And I'd like to make a request."
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh? What is it?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Phew, looks like I've bluffed my way through."
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey... you."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Tesso?",
                "I heard the rumors about you."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh?",
                "You've got it all wrong."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh?",
                "But I heard you live in the temple."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I live there, but you're mistaken.",
                "I'm not Tesso."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Since you live in a temple,",
                "isn't it the same thing?"
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What's with all this useless bickering?"
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...No, wait.",
                "My rods are picking up a faint signal."
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "......That's right."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You have a jewel, right?"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh? A jewel?",
                "I don't have any!"
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I had enough! If I have to search you",
                "to restore my power, I will!"
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I see, the moon rabbit dropped her jewel."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That jewel must be a moon treasure."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then that story about purifying life isn't",
                "too hard to believe either."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm really motivated all of a sudden!",
                "I'm definitely gonna find it!"
            ]
        },
        "132_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What is it? You look like you're having fun."
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Did you find any treasure?"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I-I-It's nothing like that, really."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...My, my."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was just trying to say hello,",
                "but I didn't realize I'd hit the nail on the head."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Mind counting me in if it's something interesting?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "13": {
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Y'know, my tanukis gather info for me.",
                "They fill me in on some interesting things."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Things like where a chupacabra's been sighted,",
                "or where you'll find a Lunar Jewel."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "!?"
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The treasure is mine and mine alone!",
                "You hyena!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "......"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Looks like you haven't found it yet."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So, this treasure you mentioned...",
                "where is it, anyway?"
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What do you say?",
                "Teaming up with me's the smart choice, right?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "14": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now, let's hear what you have to say."
            ]
        }
    },
    "3": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Shoot, it's the shrine maiden!",
                "I'm so unlucky."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll exorcise any greedy animals, right here and now!"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ummm,",
                "forgive me please!"
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Master Shou is working me into the ground."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "All these phantoms roaming about,",
                "and she makes me sweep the graves?"
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll just take it easy and",
                "get it over with."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But still,",
                "I wonder if there's any treasure to be found."
            ]
        },
        "132_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wow, what a treasure trove!"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "|\t\t,\tThe graveyard\t,Here",
                "The graveyard is full of treasures!"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eep! Orin?",
                "Why are you here?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You, uh, seem pretty excited."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You could've told me about this",
                "Great Phantasmagorial Release Festival!"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This is my favorite thing <b$ever>!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "4": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "We're fellow undergrounders, right?",
                "You don't have to brush me off like that!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't like cats.",
                "Don't you understand that?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, yeah. As an apology for surprising you,",
                "I'll give you some great treasure information."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh? Treasure?",
                "What is it?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "5": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And I get a rat as a bonus!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "6": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That was fun!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What is it?"
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm feeling a little bit up! So many exciting things!"
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And now, I'll catch a mouse,",
                "just like a cat!"
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "\"A jewel that purifies life has been found on the surface.\"",
                "That's what she told me."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If this info's coming from Orin, it's probably true."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That cat is sensitive to those who hate death.",
                "I'm getting excited all of a sudden!"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What is it?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Getting so worked up all by yourself...",
                "Did something happen?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Woah!",
                "You startled me!"
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I-It's nothing."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I have to keep quiet about the jewel."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm?"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You look suspicious.",
                "I'm going to investigate you just in case."
            ]
        }
    },
    "7": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm not hiding anything!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, whatever."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, speaking of which, have you heard any stories",
