            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Strange items?",
                "Such as?"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A jewe-I mean, something round and beautiful and orb-like."
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're an awful liar, rat."
            ]
        }
    },
    "8": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You seem to be hiding something.",
                "Would you please share it with me?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "15": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So apparently, in the Forest of Magic, a",
                "beast awakened as a youkai using the jewel."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I hate to admit it, but I'm no match for",
                "that wily tanuki's information network."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But awakening a beast with nothing but a jewel...",
                "Is that even possible?"
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Maybe it's some incredible treasure?",
                "I don't know..."
            ]
        },
        "132_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who's there?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, a mouse."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're not my target, looks like.",
                "It's dangerous 'round here, so go home."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, that pendant!"
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hm?"
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That has to be the jewel!",
                "<b$My> jewel!"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What?",
                "\"My\"?"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm gonna take it! I'll kill you if I have to!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "16": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What is your problem?"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oops, I might've been a little too hasty."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, about that pendant on your neck..."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Where did you get it?"
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, you mean this?"
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The matriarch gave it to me.",
                "She said it's very important."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The matriarch?",
                "Is she some kind of yakuza or something?"
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyway, it looks a lot like a prized",
                "possession a friend of mine is looking for."
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Could I take a closer look at it?"
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm <i$not> giving it, you know that?"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I just want to get a good look at it."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well, if you just want to look,",
                "go ahead."
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now, how do I snatch it away from her?"
            ]
        },
        "138_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What the...?",
                "I'm feeling kind of... fuzzy..."
            ]
        },
        "146_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Getting...sleepy..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "17": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What is your problem?"
            ]
        }
    },
    "18": {
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "... What is this place?"
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Where am I?",
                "What happened?"
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What? Who're you?"
            ]
        },
        "144_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Where did you come from?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't know either...",
                "Where am I?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This place is Hell, as you can see."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hell!? Not the Former Hell, but <i$actual> Hell?",
                "Eep..."
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I think it was the jewel that beast had.",
                "As soon as I touched it, I felt really drowsy..."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "..."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A jewel? Just as I've heard in the rumours...",
                "I suppose it's real after all."
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If what you're saying is true,"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It seems that the jewel is set",
                "with a trap that teleports people here."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh? A teleportation trap?"
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The beast that carried this jewel...",
                "was it a white dog, by any chance?"
            ]
        },
        "232_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's right."
            ]
        },
        "240_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Just as I thought.",
                "It's the same trap that was laid on our monkey."
            ]
        },
        "248_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then that could mean all of us are..."
            ]
        },
        "256_0": {
            "lines": [
                "??"
            ]
        },
        "264_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Heheheh, she's really done it, hasn't she?",
                "That damned human-oni!"
            ]
        },
        "272_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Um, sorry for interrupting your soliloquy,",
                "but what's going to happen to me?"
            ]
        },
        "280_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, why don't you become my subordinate?",
                "Do you wanna fight together?"
            ]
        },
        "288_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Fight?",
                "For what?"
            ]
        },
        "296_0": {
            "lines": [
                "We're going to conquer the surface.",
                "Tempting, isn't it?"
            ]
        },
        "304_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wha-this woman is an enemy.",
                "A <b$real> enemy!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You've got a great aptitude.",
